## Model cost observability (loopmath)

This project routes model calls through loopmath-agent so loop costs are
measured. When working here:

- Before running any agentic workload, ensure loopmath is up: call the
  `loopmath_status` MCP tool (or `curl 127.0.0.1:8788/healthz`). If it is
  not, call `loopmath_start` and apply the env vars it returns.
- After a workload, read `loopmath_findings`. If any finding has
  `est_savings_usd > 0.50`, propose the fix in its `recommendation` before
  moving on.
- Never paste prompt text into a finding or issue; findings are numbers only.
- Full procedure: https://gitdr.ai/agent.md
